"notInBackup.sensitive.help" = "Files that look like passwords, keys or login data are never copied as they are. You can add each one you need to the encrypted part of the backup (see “Passwords, keys and credentials”). MacReplica recognises them by name and file format only; their contents are never read, stored or logged. Keychains and browser password stores are not copied – they would not work on another Mac.";
