"bootstrap.readme" = "Start here on the new Mac: drag %1$@ from this folder into the Applications folder and open it, then choose Restore and select this folder. MacReplica is not notarized by Apple: if macOS says it cannot verify the developer, choose Done, open System Settings › Privacy & Security and click Open Anyway. The newest version is at %2$@.";
