"settings.section.help" = "MacReplica reads these settings through macOS (as the defaults tool does) and on the new Mac sets exactly the recorded ones again, then reads each one back. Settings that belong to this particular Mac, settings macOS protects (such as Accessibility and privacy permissions) and settings kept in private databases are never copied – see “Not transferred”. Settings recorded on an older macOS are offered on a newer one where their meaning is stable; keyboard shortcuts and input sources only on the same major version, because their identifiers change between releases. Nothing is applied to an older macOS without your choice.";
