"tools.gatekeeper.app.help" = "MacReplica reads the app's signature, notarisation, quarantine mark and Gatekeeper's verdict without changing anything. If macOS blocks the app, MacReplica opens it once (macOS then shows its warning) and opens Privacy & Security, where you click “Open Anyway”; afterwards MacReplica checks the app again. You can also open the app right away or – after a warning – remove its quarantine mark and put it back later. Only this one app is affected; Gatekeeper stays on for everything else.";
