"tools.updates.support.check" = "Ask Apple about this version";
"tools.updates.support.help" = "MacReplica asks Apple's servers which macOS versions this Mac can install (the same list as “softwareupdate --list-full-installers”). Apple usually fixes security problems in the newest version and the two before it, the older ones only partly; Apple publishes no end dates. Nothing is downloaded or installed.";
