"tools.gatekeeper.profileOn.button" = "Turn off app checking for this Mac…";
"tools.gatekeeper.profileOn.help" = "Advanced. MacReplica prepares a configuration profile (com.apple.systempolicy.control, “EnableAssessment = false”), the mechanism Apple provides for organisations. You install it in Device Management; afterwards no app is checked, including harmful ones. MacReplica checks the result with “spctl --status”. To undo, remove the profile; MacReplica only ever removes its own.";
"tools.gatekeeper.profileOn.confirm.title" = "Turn off app checking for the whole Mac?";
"tools.gatekeeper.profileOn.confirm.message" = "macOS will then open every app without checking its developer or Apple's malware scan – including harmful ones, also for other users of this Mac. Approving single apps with “Open Anyway” is safer. MacReplica prepares a profile; you install it in Device Management with your administrator password. You can remove it there at any time.";
