"tools.corners.limit.overlays" = "Without the plugin, Quick Look and popovers keep their own corners and menus can only switch to the classic style. The plugin needs a tweak loader (Plugin Playground) and partial SIP (debugging allowed); the picture area inside Quick Look keeps about 15 pt even then.";
