"tools.gatekeeper.quarantine.help" = "The quarantine mark tells macOS that the app was downloaded, so Gatekeeper checks it before the first launch. Removing it from this one app lets it open without that check – also without Apple's malware check. Gatekeeper stays on for every other app. Only do this for apps from a source you trust. MacReplica keeps the exact mark so you can put it back in this session; damaged apps and system apps are refused.";
