"tools.plugin.confirm.title" = "Install the corner plugin?";
"tools.plugin.confirm.message" = "MacReplica copies its two files into Plugin Playground's tweaks folder with your administrator password. Plugin Playground then loads the plugin into the apps you open (never into system UI processes) and only changes the surfaces you chose. A bug in such a plugin could make apps crash; if that happens, use “Undo setup” or delete /opt/pluginplayground/tweaks/MacReplicaCorners.dylib. Reopen apps afterwards.";
