"tools.plugin.oneClick.confirm.message" = "Steps that are already done are skipped. To reach Apple's own apps, the loader turns on “Disable arm64e (PAC)”, which runs every Apple-silicon app from an unsigned copy in /tmp and briefly switches off macOS's code-signature check — your Mac is noticeably less protected, and some apps (especially updaters and strict-signed apps) can crash or misbehave until you blacklist them. System UI is never touched. Everything can be reversed with “Undo setup…”. If the download does not match its checksum, nothing is installed.";
