"tools.plugin.undo.message" = "MacReplica removes its plugin and uninstalls Plugin Playground (its app, files, settings and background service) with your administrator password. A background service that is already running stops at the next restart. Plugin Playground changes no boot setting that would have to be reset. Afterwards restart, and in recoveryOS turn System Integrity Protection fully back on (csrutil enable); MacReplica never changes that itself.";
